# Day 4 – users
 
# What I Learned
  -view and switch users
  
# Commands Practiced
  -whoami /shows which user is running the command
  -id
  -users /shows what user is logged in
  -adduser /adds new users
# Problems I Faced
  - when i switched user with `su hacker` after adding user hacker with `sudo adduser hacker` command `users` still showed my main
  account while whoami showed hacker.
  - while creating user it asked for full name, room no etc.
# How I Fixed Them
 - learned that `su` just switches user inside shell and doesnot create new login session so users showed main account
 - password asked are for new user and other are only needed in organizations so ignore and just hit enter
